---
import { SITE } from "../../config/site";
---

<section
    id="about"
    aria-labelledby="about-heading"
    class="relative py-28 sm:py-32 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 overflow-hidden select-text"
>
    <!-- Background Accent -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-linear-to-b from-transparent via-cyan-500/5 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Section Heading -->
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2 id="about-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold neon-text">About Me</h2>

            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-400">
                A short introduction about who I am, what I work on, and how I approach learning and development.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Content Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
            <!-- IMAGE (hidden on small devices) -->
            <div class="hidden lg:flex justify-center">
                <div class="relative">
                    <!-- Soft Glow -->
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-cyan-400/20 blur-3xl scale-110 pointer-events-none"></div>

                    <img
                        src={SITE.profilePic}
                        alt={`Photo of ${SITE.fullName}`}
                        width="300"
                        height="300"
                        loading="lazy"
                        decoding="async"
                        class="relative w-72 h-72 rounded-full object-cover border-[3px] border-cyan-400/40 shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(34,211,238,0.25)]"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- TEXT -->
            <div
                class="space-y-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed select-text"
            >
                <p>
                    I'm <span class="text-cyan-300 font-medium">{SITE.fullName}</span>, a backend developer and BCA student with a
                    strong focus on building reliable, maintainable, and scalable backend systems. I primarily work with
                    <span class="text-cyan-300">Python</span> and
                    <span class="text-cyan-300">Django</span>, and I enjoy translating real-world problems into clean, practical
                    solutions.
                </p>

                <p>
                    My development experience includes working with backend frameworks such as
                    <span class="text-cyan-300">Django</span> and
                    <span class="text-cyan-300">Flask</span>, designing RESTful APIs, and managing relational databases using
                    <span class="text-cyan-300">SQL</span>. I regularly use tools like
                    <span class="text-cyan-300">Git</span>,
                    <span class="text-cyan-300">GitHub</span>, and
                    <span class="text-cyan-300">Docker</span> to maintain clean workflows, version control, and reproducible environments.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Alongside hands-on development, I actively strengthen my understanding of
                    <span class="text-cyan-300">data structures</span>,
                    <span class="text-cyan-300">algorithms</span>, and core computer science fundamentals. I believe strong
                    foundations lead to better performance, scalability, and long-term code quality.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I learn best through a balance of structured courses, building real projects, and consistent problem-solving.
                    My goal is to continuously grow as a backend engineer while contributing to meaningful, production-ready
                    systems.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
